omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LMO6ZfWE7xUQ7kNvwFE7LLC&_nc_oc=AdqDTvhAZk4xfw8sf8kBUhdaxJQd5WhKr1s8jotUN2p-9-b6w4cIfwMops3_h6NDssA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0haHNGugn9y4v3DXsfMMYZJiSF2L2iySwTHeQAGRH0pQ&oe=69D8DD74"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jPPDEC4oPyQQ7kNvwFpoWzQ&_nc_oc=Adr5LZ8V8o7TbjnuxztI9CEtIUh5mdetCYLJgjjdsNMaISaypEDzQYlSzBKMRs29pBo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1FLQX7zntKSvDlyzoXa01AMl6bhvcz5TdqvPqEV_w5MA&oe=69D8DED6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KbKWhiQEsQwQ7kNvwHpUoFl&_nc_oc=Ado87PgtO8pYf4E120DG3ThzLWglfesRUFWOZut6U7KM_lhvAk6A5svmhFouo4kg_uc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2GZgy3-w7Qgf_vEVnBnQDRAQRRh858ERdTKdQhF5KpCg&oe=69D8F3F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://